se cost a rerun or a lost shell in the 17 Oct 2026 Polys rerun"},{"@id":"px:s750","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n372"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1891"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"launch Playwright with locale 'en-US', else X_ITE throws \"Invalid language tag: en-US@posix\"."},{"@id":"px:s751","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1771"},"px:predicate":"renders","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1754"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"X_ITE 16.5.1 headless SwiftShader, scripted-viewpoint rig"},{"@id":"px:s752","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n227"},"px:predicate":"discovered_in","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1754"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"the flywheel classes (Finding, Rule, Experiment) were crowded out by hub tools until compose.py reserved quotas"},{"@id":"px:s753","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n125"},"px:predicate":"blocks","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1377"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"review the public candidate (names two public GitHub maintainers, coderextreme and ahujasid) and say \"publish\" before anything goes to x3d.poc"},{"@id":"px:s754","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2043"},"px:predicate":"maintained_by","px:object":{"@id":"px:n674"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Create `hagopjay/x3d-blender-io` on GitHub now?"},{"@id":"px:s755","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1672"},"px:predicate":"contradicts","px:object":{"@id":"px:n2080"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"the XSD rejects 163 of the 313 conclusive containment pairs the ontology predicts, so it cannot gate"},{"@id":"px:s756","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n223"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n66"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"a validator ladder (service, then fork 8c0a457, then fork eb4b4b4, re-validating stored scenes \"from the files alone\" and flagg