P server at projects.blender.org/lab/blender_mcp"},{"@id":"px:s1602","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n420"},"px:predicate":"authored_by","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1624"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"SplatGen (Shehab Mekky) preview for Blender 5.3 alpha trains Gaussian splats inside Blender"},{"@id":"px:s1603","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1801"},"px:predicate":"converts_to","px:object":{"@id":"px:n867"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"the 4.0 option degrades them to a coloured PointSet."},{"@id":"px:s1604","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2111"},"px:predicate":"writes","px:object":{"@id":"px:n867"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"vertex-only PointSet export; MetadataSet survives on Shape only."},{"@id":"px:s1605","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1801"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1333"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"and Geometry2D level 2 when the Circle2D fallback is written."},{"@id":"px:s1606","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n62"},"px:predicate":"implements","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1994"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Likely","px:evidence":"palette XML resources for `PhysicalMaterial`, `UnlitMaterial`, `Inline`, `HAnimHumanoid`, `TextureTransformMatrix3D`"},{"@id":"px:s1607","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n224"},"px:predicate":"cites","px:object":{"@id":"px:n984"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Likely","px:evidence":"#12 (splat round trip exact at any size; 01:03Z Oct 12)"},{"@id":"px:s1608","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n224"},"px:predicate":"cites","px:object":{"@id":"px:n807"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Likely","px:evidence":"Merged so far: #1 to #10 (to 19:00Z Oct 11); #11 (research showcase page with live X3D demos; 22:16Z Oct 11)"},{"@id":"px:s1609","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1654"},"px:predicate":"authored_by","px:object":{"@id":"px:n299"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"x3d_mcp bundles John Carlson's community 2020-12 schema"},{"@id":"px:s1610","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1293"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1654"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"x3d_mcp bundles John Carlson's community 2020-12 schema"},{"@id":"px:s1611","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1299"},"px:predicate":"part_of","px:object":{"@id":"px:n237"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"The 4.1-only node set, from diffing the two bundled X3DUOM files, is EnvironmentLight, FontLibrary, GaussianSplats, HAnimPose, InlineGeometry, RenderedTexture and Tangent."},{"@id":"px:s1612","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1299"},"px:predicate":"part_of","px:object":{"@id":"px:n418"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"FontLibrary is an X3DChildNode; the component is named TextureProjection"},{"@id":"px:s1613","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1067"},"px:predicate":"part_of","px:object":{"@id":"px:n237"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"The 4.1-only node set, from diffing the two bundled X3DUOM files, is EnvironmentLight, FontLibrary, GaussianSplats, HAnimPose, InlineGeometry, RenderedTexture and Tangent."},{"@id":"px:s1614","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n8"},"px:predicate":"contains","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1067"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Likely","px:evidence":"new in 4.1: EnvironmentLight, FontLibrary, GaussianSplats, HAnimPose, InlineGeometry, RenderedTexture, Tangent"},{"@id":"px:s1615","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1446"},"px:predicate":"part_of","px:object":{"@id":"px:n237"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"The 4.1-only node set, from diffing the two bundled X3DUOM files, is EnvironmentLight, FontLibrary, GaussianSplats, HAnimPose, InlineGeometry, RenderedTexture and Tangent."},{"@id":"px:s1616","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n8"},"px:predicate":"contains","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1446"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Likely","px:evidence":"new in 4.1: EnvironmentLight, FontLibrary, GaussianSplats, HAnimPose, InlineGeometry, RenderedTexture, Tangent"},{"@id":"px:s1617","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1884"},"px:predicate":"part_of","px:object":{"@id":"px:n237"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"The 4.1-only node set, from diffing the two bundled X3DUOM files, is EnvironmentLight, FontLibrary, GaussianSplats, HAnimPose, InlineGeometry, RenderedTexture and Tangent."},{"@id":"px:s1618","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n8"},"px:predicate":"contains","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1884"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Likely","px:evidence":"new in 4.1: EnvironmentLight, FontLibrary, GaussianSplats, HAnimPose, InlineGeometry, RenderedTexture, Tangent"},{"@id":"px:s1619","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n303"},"px:predicate":"blocks","px:object":{"@id":"px:n352"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"4 MiB body cap in mcp 1.30 blocks 3 of 10 Shroud scenes and all splats."},{"@id":"px:s1620","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n303"},"px:predicate":"supersedes","px:object":{"@id":"px:n301"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"With mcp 1.30.0, a `tools/call` body over 4 MiB is answered `413 Request body too large` from `Content-Length` before any tool runs; 1 MB and 3.5 MB are accepted. mcp 1.28 and earlier have no cap."},{"@id":"px:s1621","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2183"},"px:predicate":"motivates","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1206"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"`path=` is refused over HTTP, so a hosted server had no way to take a large file at all."},{"@id":"px:s1622","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n494"},"px:predicate":"motivates","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1783"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Synchronous tools run on the event loop: while a 100 MB `validate_x3d` ran, nothing else was answered for 6.7 s. Documents of 1 MiB or more now run in a worker thread."},{"@id":"px:s1623","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n81"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1206"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"modify_x3d_node(content=\"\", blob_id=\"4f2a...\", def_name=\"Lamp\", field_changes=\"{...}\", return_mode=\"blob\")"},{"@id":"px:s1624","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n81"},"px:predicate":"forked_from","px:object":{"@id":"px:n2051"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Update one or more attribute values on a DEF'd node. Field changes passed as a JSON object string. Adapted from [niknarra/x3d-mcp](https://github.com/niknarra/x3d-mcp)."},{"@id":"px:s1625","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n230"},"px:predicate":"part_of","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1206"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Under stdio there is no upload route; pass `path=` as before, or `blob_put(path=\"/abs/scene.x3d\")` to get an id you can reuse."},{"@id":"px:s1626","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1136"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n230"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Largest decoded `blob_put` payload (its base64 form and the JSON-RPC envelope must stay under the SDK's 4 MiB cap)"},{"@id":"px:s1627","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n987"},"px:predicate":"part_of","px:object":{"@id":"px:n499"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"L3 Library (PolyXandria Hall and spine) | Corpus, calibration instrument and showcase | snapshot_v1.jsonl (3,058 scenes)"},{"@id":"px:s1628","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n174"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n2304"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"repair_x3d, GeoLOD."},{"@id":"px:s1629","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1033"},"px:predicate":"renders","px:object":{"@id":"px:n2304"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"X_ITE loaded all 30 bench scenes, the five profile violations and the schema-invalid GeoLOD scene included, and drew them."},{"@id":"px:s1630","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1918"},"px:predicate":"cites","px:object":{"@id":"px:n550"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"(notes under polyxandria/notes/x3dresearch-feb2026/, executive summary and research/x3d-gaussian/technical-proposal.md)."},{"@id":"px:s1631","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n675"},"px:predicate":"discovered_in","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1776"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"In the 8 October experiment Claude got X3D and three.js scenes right at the same rate."},{"@id":"px:s1632","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n414"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n583"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"B01 splat round-trip ladder on bpy 5.2.3 with expected-loss table"},{"@id":"px:s1633","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2156"},"px:predicate":"presented_at","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1757"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"B13 prep: 5.3 probe ready for a hand-downloaded daily before the 10 Nov release"},{"@id":"px:s1634","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n468"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n491"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"B14 LangGraph skeleton with stub nodes then real writer arms (per-step yes)"},{"@id":"px:s1635","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1165"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1403"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"B18 Blender-agent A/B on the 115 clean prompts with calibrated judge set"},{"@id":"px:s1636","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n634"},"px:predicate":"cites","px:object":{"@id":"px:n287"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"See [[vertex-image-gen-recipe]], [[shroud-art-scenes-and-frame]]."},{"@id":"px:s1637","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2310"},"px:predicate":"cite