Confirmed","px:evidence":"use the Responses API with background:true, store:true, then poll GET /v1/responses/{id} (vcall provider 'openai_bg')"},{"@id":"px:s2082","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2309"},"px:predicate":"discovered_in","px:object":{"@id":"px:n349"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"spine/y9/vcheck.py: when a report has no \"## Warnings\" section, Info lines (unused-def, profile-component-fix) land in sem_errors."},{"@id":"px:s2083","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2309"},"px:predicate":"motivates","px:object":{"@id":"px:n2053"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Verdicts are right; repair prompts and class counts get Info lines. Filter them."},{"@id":"px:s2084","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2223"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1839"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"our own Cycles flight drops to 0.70 to 0.85 from parallax alone"},{"@id":"px:s2085","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n505"},"px:predicate":"uses","px:object":{"@id":"px:n2223"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"render the X3D at each pose (CPU Cycles 1600x900 16 spp, ~2 min), edgedrift render vs frame."},{"@id":"px:s2086","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n586"},"px:predicate":"cites","px:object":{"@id":"px:n2310"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"See [[splat-park-v2]]."},{"@id":"px:s2087","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1216"},"px:predicate":"evidences","px:object":{"@id":"px:n2295"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Likely","px:evidence":"the Blacksburg master (16 spatial chunks, 17 Oct) drew correctly but its loadURL promise never settled in 407 s and a poll saw no Inline nodes: same signature, so treat this as the leading explanation"},{"@id":"px:s2088","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1786"},"px:predicate":"cites","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1206"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"both tools run in a worker thread under the same process-wide lock as other heavy tools (see transfer-layer.md), one job at a time."},{"@id":"px:s2089","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n1429"},"px:predicate":"validates","px:object":{"@id":"px:n1659"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"The 65 MB six-decimal scene is still not checkable with it on: the XSD engine's own failure is caught and reported (868 MB peak)."},{"@id":"px:s2090","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n788"},"px:predicate":"writes","px:object":{"@id":"px:n686"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"most X3D text one `splat_chunk` call may produce, estimated from a sample before cutting; the files are held in memory until stored"},{"@id":"px:s2091","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2255"},"px:predicate":"evidences","px:object":{"@id":"px:n2305"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"Memory, Confirmed on synthetic 10,000,000-splat files (random bytes in a valid layout; the cost depends on the count and SH degree, not on the content): decoding SH degree 0 takes 4.8 s and peaks at 971 MB resident"},{"@id":"px:s2092","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n405"},"px:predicate":"forked_from","px:object":{"@id":"px:n600"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"HagopJay's forks: playcanvas/splat-transform"},{"@id":"px:s2093","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n405"},"px:predicate":"authored_by","px:object":{"@id":"px:n674"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"HagopJay's forks: playcanvas/splat-transform"},{"@id":"px:s2094","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2097"},"px:predicate":"authored_by","px:object":{"@id":"px:n674"},"prov":"doc","grade":"Confirmed","px:evidence":"HagopJay's forks: playcanvas/splat-transform (latest upstream 3.10.0, Oct 6, 2026) and sakalond/StableGen"},{"@id":"px:s2095","@type":"px:Statement","px:subject":{"@id":"px:n2097"},"px:predicate":"forked_from","px:object":{"@id":"px: